            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Ha Noi - Bun Cha Ho Guom",
            "review_text": "Angie C\nMalaysia88 contributions\n2\nFantastic food with English menu\nNov 2022 • Friends\nThis little unassuming place has good reviews on the map, and I really wanted some dry Vietnamese noodles, so decided on this that wasn't far from my hotel in District 1 and close to the Saigon Skydeck. All I can say it was really good!! I wish I could eat more! Great pork, broth and the veggies could be fresher, love the yogurt ice, but overall a very good local experience!\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-13",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
